      "id": "cad.revolve.preview",
      "title": "Preview revolve extents",
      "description": "Evaluate saved revolve direction and angles without saving. Angles are degrees; symmetric centers the primary angle and requires zero opposite angle. Total sweep cannot exceed 360 degrees.",
